<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p>Dear&nbsp;{{{Recipient.FirstName}}},<br />
<br />
We hope this email finds you well. We wanted to reach out to you because we noticed that you haven't purchased any leads from EverQuote recently.&nbsp;</p>

<p>At <a href="https://resources.everquote.com/">EverQuote </a> we understand that finding new business can be challenging, which is why we offer a variety of high-quality lead types to help you grow your insurance business.&nbsp; We are continuously working to improve our lead generation and delivery process, which includes regular quality checks, to ensure that our leads meet the highest standards.<br />
<br />
We understand that there may be many options available to you in the market,&nbsp;but we want you to know that carrier testing shows a <em>34% higher conversion rate</em> with EverQuote vs. traditional lead vendors.</p>

<p>We appreciate your past business with EverQuote and hope to have the opportunity to work with you again.&nbsp; Feel free to schedule a meeting to learn more -&nbsp;{{{Sender.Salesforce_Meeting_Link__c}}}.<br />
<br />
Best regards,<br />
{{{Sender.FirstName}}}</p>
